+*   **Performance:** Distributed implementations reduce network bandwidth by compositing only neighboring nodes [S2, unofficial]. Hardware acceleration is commonly used for shading computations [S3, unofficial].
+*   **Strengths:** Associative nature enables efficient distributed rendering and hierarchical compositing [S2, unofficial][S5, unofficial].
+*   **Limitations:** Requires strict depth ordering [S5, unofficial].
